# Standing decisions - the AI reads these on every job. Copy to decisions.md and edit.
# Plain language. Shared by every app that uses this gateway, so write rules about your setup,
# and put job-specific sections under their own heading.

## About my setup
- One Docker host ("my-server"), apps run with Docker Compose, data on ZFS with snapshots.
- Internet-facing apps: nginx-proxy-manager, vaultwarden, nextcloud. Everything else is home-only.

## Rules
- Database major upgrades are planned migrations, never routine updates.
- WordPress: change the staging copy first, then production.
